OL,3,ABus hits train stopped on French side
OL,4,Aof Channel Tunnel, with 19 injured
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bus has hit a stationary freight
OL,7,Ftrain near the French entrance to the
OL,8,FChannel Tunnel, injuring the driver and
OL,9,F18 passengers, French authorities say.
OL,11,FThe bus, which was carrying lorry
OL,12,Fdrivers due to take a shuttle rail
OL,13,Fservice, struck the train at the
OL,14,Floading platform of the tunnel in
OL,15,FCoquelles, near Calais, at 19:27 (18:27
OL,16,FBST) on Thursday.
OL,18,FThe bus driver and one passenger were
OL,19,Fseverely injured and evacuated by
OL,20,Fhelicopter. None of the injuries were
OL,21,Flife threatening, a local official
OL,22,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
