OL,3,ABus hits train stopped on French side
OL,4,Aof Channel Tunnel, with 19 injured
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal sub-prefect Agathe Cury said
OL,7,Ffreight and Eurostar passenger traffic
OL,8,Fthrough the tunnel had not been
OL,9,Fdisrupted after a brief stoppage to
OL,10,Fevacuate injured people. An
OL,11,Finvestigation has begun.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
